    "notes": "Supply (2-13 terminal 30, 1-1 terminal 15) and K-line (3-28) agree between sources. The GROUND pin is deliberately left out: Transpondery says 1-5, ecupinouts says 1-6. Identify ground on your unit by continuity to the housing/other ground pins before powering.",
